Lana's a metropolis. She's visiting her aunt now.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.609
Clark, are you okay?

00:00:50.609 --> 00:01:00.299
Kara, do you ever think about your parents and it feels like they're calling out to you?

00:01:00.299 --> 00:01:05.620
Yeah, I mean, I'm always thinking about my family.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:10.540
My mom and dad will always be with me.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:12.540
And so will Lara.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:18.140
Just I feel like I know something about Jeryl, but my mother, she's always been a mystery to me.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.599
I have an idea.

00:01:22.599 --> 00:01:25.599
I will tell you everything you ever wanted to know

00:01:25.599 --> 00:01:29.599
about the incredible Laura Elle in the morning.

