00:02:42.659 --> 00:02:45.659
We need to help her.

00:02:45.659 --> 00:02:51.659
Every experiment my brother conducted was motivated by power and greed.

00:02:51.659 --> 00:02:54.659
Hurry, my son, I have little time about it.

00:02:54.659 --> 00:02:58.659
Do not allow human emotions to cloud your judgment.

00:02:58.659 --> 00:03:01.659
I will turn my back on my mother.

00:03:01.659 --> 00:03:30.599
Is that you?

00:03:30.599 --> 00:05:16.500
Never see you again.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.420
Dream this started out like a nightmare.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.420
When I heard your voice, you were in trouble.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.420
The last I remember the world was exploding around

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.420
me.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.420
Well, you must have heard my cries.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:32.149
