00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.660
What?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.660
Sweetheart. I'm so happy you managed to escape.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:55.660
My father put me in a ship and sent me way in the nick of time.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:59.800
