00:06:33.009 --> 00:06:35.009
And he is dangerous.

00:06:35.009 --> 00:06:43.470
It doesn't matter.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.470
There's three of us in one of him.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:07:07.180
Where's the face?

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.180
LASIC, anyone?

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:11.180
It's right there.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.180
That's not a face. That's a blur.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:16.180
A compromising page one.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:20.180
pick of our philandering mayor needs two eyes, a nose, and a mouth.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.180
