00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.930
Forget the pictures then. The story speaks for itself.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:43.930
Golden boy mayor throws it all away for raven-haired nanny.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:51.050
What the hell is he smoking?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:55.480
