00:08:40.549 --> 00:08:43.019
It was a pretty mug.

00:08:43.019 --> 00:08:49.450
an edge-of-your-seed on underground cage fighting.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:53.450
It was just a coincidence that you happened to be incredibly irresistible.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:09:40.059
My dear Kara, you're all right.

00:09:40.059 --> 00:09:51.450
