00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:21.240
Especially taking my family for granted.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:25.960
Our planet is gone, Kara.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:33.539
Family is the only thing we have left.

00:10:33.539 --> 00:10:36.980
