00:10:49.379 --> 00:10:52.759
With Lara and Kallel.

00:10:52.759 --> 00:11:00.950
As a family, you just have to trust me.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:07.620
I want to.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:11.529
It's all right.

00:11:11.529 --> 00:11:23.450
You must go to the fortress, Kara.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.450
Wait for me.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.450
for me.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:48.659
Vessel.

