00:19:49.539 --> 00:19:54.170
Don't let it overpower the goodness.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:58.220
You must fight it.

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.220
Laura!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.220
Lana, leave.

